    ## Reads `data-<name>`.
    weave dataset with e as Element, name as string into result of maybe string to js.JsError:
        return calling get_attr with e, "data-{name}"

    ## Writes `data-<name>`.
    weave set_dataset with e as Element, name as string, value as string into result of bool to js.JsError:
        return calling set_attr with e, "data-{name}", value

    ## `parent.appendChild(child)`.
    weave append with parent as Element, child as Element into result of bool to js.JsError:
        var args as list of js.JsValue is list of js.JsValue
        defer banish args
        calling args.push with child._v
        var r as result of js.JsValue to js.JsError is calling js.call_method with parent._v, "appendChild", args
        if not r.is_ok:
