        return calling ok_of with true

    ## `element.remove()`.
    weave remove with e as Element into result of bool to js.JsError:
        return calling _call_void with e, "remove"

    ## `element.replaceWith(other)`.
    weave replace_with with e as Element, other as Element into result of bool to js.JsError:
        var args as list of js.JsValue is list of js.JsValue
