    weave set_checked with e as Element, checked as bool into result of bool to js.JsError:
        var flag as int is if checked then 1 else 0
        var b as result of js.JsValue to js.JsError is calling js.from_int with flag
        if not b.is_ok:
            return calling err_of with b.error
        defer calling js.release with b.value
        return calling js.set with e._v, "checked", b.value

